OL,3,GNEWSABoy, 15, arrested after fire at
OL,4,Aformer town hall
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 15-year-old boy has been arrested
OL,7,Ffollowing a fire at a former theatre
OL,8,Fand town hall on the Isle of Wight.
OL,10,FFlames were visible in the building's
OL,11,Ftop-floor windows as crews battled the
OL,12,Fblaze on Lind Street, Ryde, after it
OL,13,Fbroke out at about 23:30 BST on 26
OL,14,FAugust.
OL,16,FIt spread to the roof with firefighters
OL,17,Fbringing the fire at the Grade II
OL,18,Flisted building near the town's
OL,19,Fseafront and pier under control in the
OL,20,Fearly hours the following day.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
