OL,3,GNEWSABoy, 15, arrested after fire at
OL,4,Aformer town hall
OL,5,
OL,6,FIsle of Wight police said the teenage
OL,7,Fboy from Ryde, arrested on suspicion of
OL,8,Farson, had been bailed with conditions
OL,9,Funtil 28 November.
